Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier III:</th><td>6 to 16 &#8203; + 1 to 4 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier IV:</th><td>7 to 21 &#8203; + 1 to 6 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier V:</th><td>8 to 26 &#8203; + 1 to 8 per Artificer Level</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Use\" title=\"Rune Arm Use\">Artificer Rune Arm Use</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a> or <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">140 / 140\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow: